{"assets":["/statement-assets/057748967c32552fb7dec5c63823e0871d595872aba77a75649e26a4a7a07fe1.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1208","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"H. Red Blue Tree"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"5 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given a tree of $$$n$$$ nodes. The tree is rooted at node $$$1$$$, which is not considered as a leaf regardless of its degree."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each leaf of the tree has one of the two colors: "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"red"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" or "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"blue"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". Leaf node $$$v$$$ initially has color $$$s_{v}$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The color of each of the internal nodes (including the root) is determined as follows. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Let $$$b$$$ be the number of "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"blue"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" immediate children, and $$$r$$$ be the number of "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"red"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" immediate children of a given vertex. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Then the color of this vertex is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"blue"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" if and only if $$$b - r \\ge k$$$, otherwise "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"red"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Integer $$$k$$$ is a parameter that is same for all the nodes."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You need to handle the following types of queries: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1 v"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":": print the color of node $$$v$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"2 v c"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":": change the color of leaf $$$v$$$ to $$$c$$$ ($$$c = 0$$$ means red, $$$c = 1$$$ means blue); "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"3 h"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":": update the current value of $$$k$$$ to $$$h$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of the input consists of two integers $$$n$$$ and $$$k$$$ ($$$2 \\le n \\le 10^{5}$$$, $$$-n \\le k \\le n$$$) — the number of nodes and the initial parameter $$$k$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each of the next $$$n - 1$$$ lines contains two integers $$$u$$$ and $$$v$$$ ($$$1 \\le u,v \\le n$$$), denoting that there is an edge between vertices $$$u$$$ and $$$v$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The next line consists of $$$n$$$ space separated integers — the initial array $$$s$$$ ($$$-1 \\le s_i \\le 1$$$). $$$s_{i} = 0$$$ means that the color of node $$$i$$$ is red. $$$s_{i} = 1$$$ means that the color of node $$$i$$$ is blue. $$$s_{i} = -1$$$ means that the node $$$i$$$ is not a leaf."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The next line contains an integer $$$q$$$ ($$$1 \\le q \\le 10^5$$$), the number of queries."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$q$$$ lines follow, each containing a query in one of the following queries: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1 v"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" ($$$1 \\le v \\le n$$$): print the color of node $$$v$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"2 v c"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" ($$$1 \\le v \\le n$$$, $$$c = 0$$$ or $$$c = 1$$$): change the color of leaf $$$v$$$ to $$$c$$$ ($$$c = 0$$$ means red, $$$c = 1$$$ means blue). It is guaranteed that $$$v$$$ is a leaf; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"3 h"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" ($$$-n \\le h \\le n$$$): update the current value of $$$k$$$ to $$$h$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each query of the first type, print $$$0$$$ if the color of vertex $$$v$$$ is red, and $$$1$$$ otherwise."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5 2\n1 2\n1 3\n2 4\n2 5\n-1 -1 0 1 0\n9\n1 1\n1 2\n3 -2\n1 1\n1 2\n3 1\n2 5 1\n1 1\n1 2\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n0\n0\n1\n1\n0\n1\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Figures:"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"(i) The initial tree "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"(ii) The tree after the 3rd query "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"(iii) The tree after the 7th query "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/057748967c32552fb7dec5c63823e0871d595872aba77a75649e26a4a7a07fe1.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"H","problemCode":"1208H","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1208/problem/H"}